{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     training-module.hbs — kept ONLY as Ghost's custom-template escape hatch.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     The module page itself now lives in partials/post/training-module.hbs and
     is dispatched by post.hbs, which is the only thing that can actually
     render a single post. See the note at the top of that partial for why
     this file could not.

     This remains so that a module post can still opt in explicitly via
     Ghost's custom_template field, and so that anything already pointing at
     `training-module` keeps resolving rather than silently falling back to
     index.hbs — the failure scripts/check-routes.mjs now exists to catch.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
{{#post}}
{{> "post/training-module"}}
{{/post}}
